WEBVTT

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:23.450
Why have I continued with my
research all this time?

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:27.590
Has my work actually helped anyone?

00:00:28.060 --> 00:00:30.260
Hasn't it only made Kurau suffer?

00:00:30.670 --> 00:00:34.130
All it's done is cause pain for Kurau...

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:41.270
Excuse me.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:43.270
Dr. Amami.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:45.480
Why, you're...

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:48.410
it's been a while, Dr. Amami.

00:00:48.410 --> 00:00:50.150
I'm here to pick you up.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:51.380
Pick me up?

00:00:51.380 --> 00:00:55.360
Please come with me. Kurau's calling for you.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.740
Kurau is... calling me?

00:00:57.740 --> 00:01:00.490
Kurau's asking for your help.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.870
Please help her, Dr. Amami!

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:09.790
Keep on holding me

00:01:05.960 --> 00:01:14.670
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:14.670
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:27.490
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:27.490
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:32.680
The precious arms

00:01:28.110 --> 00:01:37.660
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:01:32.680 --> 00:01:37.680
I have been searching for so hard

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:44.990
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:44.990
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:54.490
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:54.490
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:01:54.670 --> 00:02:01.740
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:01:54.670 --> 00:02:01.740
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:09.640
But if you remain by my side

00:02:02.280 --> 00:02:09.640
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:13.950
Keep on holding me

00:02:10.220 --> 00:02:17.610
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:17.620
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:24.790
I want to protect this love for always

00:02:17.620 --> 00:02:24.790
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:30.140
This love...

00:02:25.060 --> 00:02:30.140
Omoi wo

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:39.470
The Light At The End

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:43.470
Kurau's body has weakened.

00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:47.730
Every time she uses Rynax power,
she gets weaker and weaker.

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:50.730
She says it'll take time for her to recover.

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:53.860
For now, Christmas has been able to take care of her.

00:02:53.860 --> 00:02:56.370
But if Kurau strains herself any more,

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:59.570
Christmas is worried that she may
no longer be able to help her.

00:03:00.320 --> 00:03:02.710
But they're fighting.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:05.080
Those two are fighting...

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.620
In order to save the Rynax.

00:03:36.360 --> 00:03:37.940
The GPO...

00:03:37.940 --> 00:03:41.320
I can't be captured yet.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:47.080
Kurau! How's it going over there?

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:49.000
Have you found Windt?

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:51.890
No, he's no longer here.

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:54.540
It's been a while since I felt the power of his Rynax.

00:03:54.930 --> 00:03:57.300
If he's okay, then he might have gone somewhere else.

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.760
What are you going to do, Kurau?

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:01.700
I'm going to head over there, too.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:04.390
I'm sure Windt is on the Moon.

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:05.850
If that's the case, then...

00:04:05.850 --> 00:04:08.480
So you think he went to see Commissioner Saito?

00:04:08.480 --> 00:04:10.850
I think so...

00:04:11.510 --> 00:04:13.210
Windt is hurt.

00:04:13.210 --> 00:04:16.520
He's been driven into a corner
and is full of anger and sadness.

00:04:17.190 --> 00:04:18.400
We have to stop him...

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:20.360
No matter what.

00:04:37.170 --> 00:04:40.710
Here I thought you'd disappeared,
and suddenly you're back.

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:44.090
What the hell is security doing?

00:04:44.470 --> 00:04:48.180
I no longer need your permission
to enter the premises.

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:50.770
And I no longer have to sneak around either.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:55.850
I received approval from the GPO
Internal Affairs Department.

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.440
You are hereby summoned
to a court of inquiry.

00:05:00.360 --> 00:05:04.780
The incidents caused by the twins in
Switzerland resulted in many deaths.

00:05:05.300 --> 00:05:10.580
And the numerous experiments you conducted
to create the Ryna sapien squad

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.540
have also resulted in many human deaths.

00:05:13.270 --> 00:05:17.710
It seems your collaborators have decided they can no longer cover for you.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:22.710
They lack ideals after all...

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:23.880
Ideals...

00:05:24.550 --> 00:05:29.300
I know that you've always
wanted to strengthen the GPO.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:33.260
After the GPO was established,
all conflicts have ceased.

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:35.730
But I know that you were not satisfied with just that.

00:05:36.630 --> 00:05:39.310
You sought out an even more perfect peace.

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:42.070
And I still intend to do so.

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:46.650
But the methods you used to do this were criminal!

00:05:47.410 --> 00:05:50.660
Do you think you people can protect this world?

00:05:50.660 --> 00:05:54.120
People like you who only know of peaceful times!

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:01.460
If I didn't want to protect it, I wouldn't be here.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:07.130
At the inquiry, the Internal Affairs Department
will also question your involvement

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.090
in former Commissioner Steiger's death.

00:06:13.770 --> 00:06:18.020
We have received word that the escaped
Ryna sapien is after you.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:20.310
We ask that you follow our instructions.

00:06:22.640 --> 00:06:25.530
Ayaka, have you located Windt?

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:29.650
I received word that he made contact with
a patrol ship at the spaceport,

00:06:29.650 --> 00:06:31.950
but his whereabouts after that are unknown.

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:35.890
We haven't received any signals
from Windt's implanted chip either.

00:06:35.890 --> 00:06:38.490
Kurau is looking for him with Christmas.

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:39.960
But they haven't found him yet.

00:06:39.960 --> 00:06:44.900
I see... All right, keep monitoring the area.

00:06:44.900 --> 00:06:46.130
Oh, and Ayaka...

00:06:47.090 --> 00:06:48.970
We have Saito in custody.

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:52.510
I see. Yes...

00:06:52.510 --> 00:06:53.720
No, I'm fine.

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.720
I will continue policing the area.

00:06:57.650 --> 00:06:59.480
Ayaka? What's the matter?

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:03.230
It seems anticlimactic now that it's over.

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:11.320
W-What?!

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.740
A freight ship has entered the no-fly zone?

00:07:15.280 --> 00:07:17.040
Ayaka! He's here!

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:18.660
It's the Ryna sapien!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:28.550
Kurau!

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.590
Are you okay? Can you do it?

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:31.810
Hang in there!

00:07:31.810 --> 00:07:33.720
I'm fine, Christmas.

00:07:34.100 --> 00:07:35.880
We have to hurry...

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:37.640
We have to find Windt and stop him...

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:39.930
What's that?!

00:07:47.440 --> 00:07:48.480
Windt!

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:55.530
No way... How could this be?

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:06.380
Windt.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.000
That's impossible!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.670
Order all personnel to evacuate!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:28.860
ARU Pod squad, move out and intercept!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:34.780
Windt, please stop!

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:38.080
If you keep using your powers,
you'll end up destroying yourself!

00:08:38.080 --> 00:08:40.040
Please listen to me!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:42.540
Kurau!

00:08:45.040 --> 00:08:47.210
Oh no! Run!

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:48.920
Windt!

00:08:56.300 --> 00:08:58.930
Ayaka, the AR System isn't working on him!

00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:00.970
Don't assume he's in the cockpit!

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:03.100
Give them orders to aim for the engine room!

00:09:03.470 --> 00:09:04.970
But how are we going to do this?

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:07.850
How can we stop something that huge?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:12.440
What are we going to do, Kurau? At this rate...

00:09:12.440 --> 00:09:14.650
Windt! Are you planning on crashing that thing?

00:09:14.650 --> 00:09:16.160
If you do that, then...

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:19.370
Christmas! Lend me your power!

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:20.370
We have to stop Windt!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:20.950
Okay!

00:09:24.290 --> 00:09:25.250
Is that you, Kurau?

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:26.210
Stay out of my way!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:28.210
Windt! Don't do it!

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.210
If you crash this thing, many people will die!

00:09:36.840 --> 00:09:37.760
Kurau!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:10.500
Saito! There you are!

00:10:12.250 --> 00:10:13.210
Get outta my way!

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.210
Windt!

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.800
That's right. There's no time!

00:10:16.800 --> 00:10:18.840
Activate the shield around the shelter walls!

00:10:18.840 --> 00:10:20.260
Don't let the Ryna sapien near him!

00:10:20.850 --> 00:10:23.060
We got this far. Don't let Saito get killed!

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:33.110
He's going straight for Saito.

00:10:33.110 --> 00:10:36.490
Kimura! Go in from Gate 3. We're going after him!

00:10:36.490 --> 00:10:37.150
Yes, ma'am!

00:10:41.620 --> 00:10:44.160
Inspector Wong, the preparations are complete.

00:10:44.160 --> 00:10:45.370
Where's the Ryna sapien?

00:10:45.370 --> 00:10:47.200
C3 on the 3rd floor in the main building.

00:10:47.200 --> 00:10:48.580
He'll be on this floor soon.

00:11:10.060 --> 00:11:13.520
Ayaka, this Ryna sapien who is after
Commissioner Saito...

00:11:13.520 --> 00:11:15.400
Can we really stop him?

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:19.320
Can we protect Commissioner Saito?

00:11:28.750 --> 00:11:29.790
Ayaka?

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:35.250
Protect...

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:37.880
Saito?

00:11:43.970 --> 00:11:45.260
Why am I...

00:11:47.260 --> 00:11:48.640
Why am I doing this?

00:11:50.940 --> 00:11:52.390
Damn it!

00:11:53.650 --> 00:11:54.770
Damn it!

00:12:00.780 --> 00:12:02.400
Damn it!

00:12:03.240 --> 00:12:07.280
Damn it... Damn it... Damn it...

00:12:08.410 --> 00:12:09.410
DAMN IT!

00:12:18.800 --> 00:12:19.710
Kurau!

00:12:20.760 --> 00:12:22.930
C-Christmas, I...

00:12:22.930 --> 00:12:26.070
You were thrown out of the sky...
and fell into the river...

00:12:26.070 --> 00:12:27.050
By Windt...

00:12:27.470 --> 00:12:28.260
Windt?

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:30.470
Windt!

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.430
Stop, Windt...

00:12:49.430 --> 00:12:50.200
That's enough.

00:12:56.210 --> 00:12:58.090
S-Stop...

00:12:58.090 --> 00:12:59.090
Stop!

00:13:00.300 --> 00:13:02.420
Stop, Windt...

00:13:03.550 --> 00:13:04.340
Please...

00:13:04.800 --> 00:13:06.180
No more killing.

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:09.560
Please just stop.

00:13:33.610 --> 00:13:36.000
My younger brother died because of you.

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:37.620
You're going to pay for it.

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:43.130
Rynax... You uncontrollable monster...

00:13:43.630 --> 00:13:45.840
Not as much as you are.

00:14:30.060 --> 00:14:30.720
Windt!

00:14:45.360 --> 00:14:46.360
Windt!

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:00.430
Kurau! Kurau!

00:15:00.430 --> 00:15:03.130
I'm all right. I'm fine.

00:15:03.130 --> 00:15:04.630
But Windt is...

00:15:25.150 --> 00:15:27.360
T-That's...

00:15:27.360 --> 00:15:29.900
Rynax are pouring out!

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:33.410
We have to hurry!

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.910
We have to stop the Rynax!

00:15:41.170 --> 00:15:42.050
Windt!

00:15:45.630 --> 00:15:46.750
Oh, no...

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:48.300
They keep pouring out...

00:15:51.950 --> 00:15:54.640
They're confused by this vast world.

00:15:54.640 --> 00:15:56.760
They haven't noticed the people yet.

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:59.630
I must return them to their world before it's too late.

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:10.190
It's my fault.

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:13.200
Dr. Amami...

00:16:13.730 --> 00:16:15.950
This is all my fault.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:21.600
If only I hadn't done research on the Rynax,
this never would have happened.

00:16:22.250 --> 00:16:25.920
I didn't have to put Kurau through such hardship.

00:16:30.480 --> 00:16:32.690
To all citizens.

00:16:32.690 --> 00:16:34.970
A state of emergency has been declared.

00:16:34.970 --> 00:16:38.220
Please evacuate quickly to the designated shelters.

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.190
Rynax! They're fast!

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:51.690
Christmas, take care of Windt.

00:16:51.690 --> 00:16:53.280
Return him to his world.

00:16:53.280 --> 00:16:56.910
I'll return the Rynax that have
poured out back to their world.

00:16:56.910 --> 00:16:59.700
Kurau... Is your body okay? Can you do it?

00:17:00.870 --> 00:17:03.460
It's easy. I've done it before.

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:05.370
Okay.

00:17:06.210 --> 00:17:07.460
I'll take care of Windt.

00:17:07.460 --> 00:17:09.250
Okay, I'll leave him to you.

00:17:20.100 --> 00:17:20.890
Kurau...

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:28.110
Kurau...

00:17:34.250 --> 00:17:36.150
No, Rynax, stop!

00:17:36.570 --> 00:17:38.160
You mustn't do that!

00:17:38.160 --> 00:17:39.280
Go back!

00:17:39.280 --> 00:17:42.160
You mustn't come out into this world!

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:50.590
This world... This wide world...

00:17:52.630 --> 00:17:53.550
I'm sorry...

00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:57.970
All of you... I'm so sorry...

00:18:01.050 --> 00:18:03.640
What can I possibly do?

00:18:04.470 --> 00:18:06.060
After all this, what can I do?

00:18:06.950 --> 00:18:10.780
All I can do is kill the Rynax.

00:18:10.780 --> 00:18:14.150
After ten years of work, that's all I could do!

00:18:15.020 --> 00:18:16.070
Rynax...

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:19.320
The Rynax inside Kurau...

00:18:19.950 --> 00:18:21.410
I can't kill it...

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:24.790
I can't kill the Rynax inside Kurau.

00:18:25.570 --> 00:18:28.210
She named it Christmas.

00:18:29.940 --> 00:18:32.340
She named her Pair Christmas!

00:18:33.960 --> 00:18:36.300
That girl is my daughter.

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:38.970
Even though she's Rynax,

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.180
Kurau is still my daughter!

00:18:42.620 --> 00:18:47.390
Yet I can't save her!

00:18:49.060 --> 00:18:52.610
Even though she's suffering,
I can't do anything for her.

00:18:53.820 --> 00:18:56.650
Kurau said she wanted to see you.

00:18:57.300 --> 00:18:59.910
It's not that you can't do anything.

00:19:00.530 --> 00:19:04.120
Your daughter is saying she wants to see you!

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:06.170
Of course, there's something you can do!

00:19:06.170 --> 00:19:08.580
There's something you should do!

00:19:09.040 --> 00:19:11.580
Am I right, Dr. Amami?

00:19:23.550 --> 00:19:24.550
Yes...

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:28.680
Inspector Wong. Yes, I can see it.

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:29.980
The flow of the Rynax.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:31.650
Dr. Amami!

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:33.360
Kurau is...

00:19:33.360 --> 00:19:35.440
Kurau is alone...

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:37.400
Fighting alone over there!

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:38.900
Against the Rynax!

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:08.270
Kurau...

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:10.100
Kurau...

00:20:11.020 --> 00:20:13.650
Kurau... Kurau...

00:20:13.650 --> 00:20:14.270
Kurau!

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:18.150
Follow him!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:18.780
Yes!

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:37.920
The Rynax are angry... I don't blame them.

00:20:37.920 --> 00:20:42.300
They finally came out into the wide world, only to face this.

00:20:42.940 --> 00:20:44.220
But you mustn't...

00:20:44.220 --> 00:20:46.180
You mustn't come out into this world.

00:20:46.180 --> 00:20:48.890
Go back! Please! Rynax!

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:54.550
I have to hurry or Kurau will...

00:20:54.550 --> 00:20:56.230
I have to go help her or she'll...

00:20:57.750 --> 00:20:59.480
it's going to be too late...

00:20:59.480 --> 00:21:01.860
If I don't hurry, it'll be too late...

00:21:12.660 --> 00:21:13.500
Kurau...

00:21:14.370 --> 00:21:16.710
Kurau... Kurau...

00:21:16.710 --> 00:21:18.750
Kurau!

00:21:24.970 --> 00:21:27.050
I'm coming now! Kurau!

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:28.800
Please wait for me!

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:46.970
From a great distance

00:21:40.070 --> 00:21:46.970
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:56.310
You smile at me

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:56.310
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:05.450
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.480 --> 00:22:05.450
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:14.530
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:14.530
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.800 --> 00:22:23.770
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.800 --> 00:22:23.770
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:32.880
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.910 --> 00:22:32.880
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:35.050 --> 00:22:42.020
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:35.050 --> 00:22:42.020
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.160 --> 00:22:51.130
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.160 --> 00:22:51.130
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.370 --> 00:23:00.340
Moonlight

00:22:53.370 --> 00:23:00.340
Moonlight

00:23:10.020 --> 00:23:22.040
Yume no iriguchi touku de Kimi ga warau
At the entrance to a dream you smile in the distance

00:23:10.030 --> 00:23:12.030
Next Episode

00:23:16.160 --> 00:23:18.910
I'm always here...

00:23:22.040 --> 00:23:25.050
Before the Goodbye
